    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Newsletter sign-up (claim free gift \ud83c\udf81): website link in the sidebar \u27a1</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/57a9ff2803106606f14ac4d02c42601b.avif?t=1755615483\" width=625 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is <i>not</i> a management game!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D&amp;D-inspired visual novel with 8 unique characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive reading experience of at least 6 hours on your first play-through. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narrative with 3 unique endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual drink mixing and quest building with a dash of challenge \u2013 a refinement of the original game\u2019s mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LGBTQ+ positive representation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content warning: mentions of death, grief, and violence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new standalone game in the <i>Tavern Talk</i> universe!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Once Upon A Time...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a little, bleary portside town in the south-east of Phesoa. There, 36 years before the events of <i>Tavern Talk</i>, you dive into the role of the Tavernkeep, the owner of <i>The Drowsy Dragon</i>, a small quayside bar on the coast of Borkam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/51a56374d46db2c5dbb3948e1ebaa22e.poster.avif?t=1755615483\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/51a56374d46db2c5dbb3948e1ebaa22e.webm?t=1755615483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/51a56374d46db2c5dbb3948e1ebaa22e.mp4?t=1755615483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a special ability, gifted by one of the Great Dragon Gods or acquired through wizardly hubris: Mixing magic drinks that can alter the fate of your guests\u2014be it mean mercenaries, savvy sailors or ambitious adventurers. Every guest, no matter who they are, has a place in your warm tavern by the seaside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Drowsy Dragon</i>, fate is not written in the stars, it is written in the menu! Mix unique drinks from a wide ensemble of magical potions\u2014but be aware: There is more than one solution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/75676594e4e41a1478856cd04c9da79f.poster.avif?t=1755615483\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/75676594e4e41a1478856cd04c9da79f.webm?t=1755615483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/75676594e4e41a1478856cd04c9da79f.mp4?t=1755615483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you listen to stories brimming with the spirit of adventure, you sit within the cozy walls of your tavern and pick up rumors to turn them into quests. Some of them are old sailor\u2019s yarn, so sort them thoroughly before sticking them up the wall! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you meet new and familiar faces, all seems well. Your establishment is flourishing and friendships are made. All until something starts brewing on the horizon, something that\u2019s going to twist your brightest dreams into your darkest nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/c3f124cae6dc6ca7bb490d5e14bce495.avif?t=1755615483\" width=640 height=205 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in every good Pen &amp; Paper campaign, <i>Tavern Talk Stories: Dreamwalker</i> touches topics that may hit right in the feels. Please be aware that there will be mentions of death, grief and violence.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is <i>not</i> a management game!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D&amp;D-inspired visual novel with 8 unique characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive reading experience of at least 6 hours on your first play-through. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narrative with 3 unique endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual drink mixing and quest building with a dash of challenge \u2013 a refinement of the original game\u2019s mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LGBTQ+ positive representation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content warning: mentions of death, grief, and violence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new standalone game in the <i>Tavern Talk</i> universe!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Once Upon A Time...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a little, bleary portside town in the south-east of Phesoa. There, 36 years before the events of <i>Tavern Talk</i>, you dive into the role of the Tavernkeep, the owner of <i>The Drowsy Dragon</i>, a small quayside bar on the coast of Borkam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/51a56374d46db2c5dbb3948e1ebaa22e.poster.avif?t=1755615483\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/51a56374d46db2c5dbb3948e1ebaa22e.webm?t=1755615483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/51a56374d46db2c5dbb3948e1ebaa22e.mp4?t=1755615483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a special ability, gifted by one of the Great Dragon Gods or acquired through wizardly hubris: Mixing magic drinks that can alter the fate of your guests\u2014be it mean mercenaries, savvy sailors or ambitious adventurers. Every guest, no matter who they are, has a place in your warm tavern by the seaside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Drowsy Dragon</i>, fate is not written in the stars, it is written in the menu! Mix unique drinks from a wide ensemble of magical potions\u2014but be aware: There is more than one solution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/75676594e4e41a1478856cd04c9da79f.poster.avif?t=1755615483\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/75676594e4e41a1478856cd04c9da79f.webm?t=1755615483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/75676594e4e41a1478856cd04c9da79f.mp4?t=1755615483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you listen to stories brimming with the spirit of adventure, you sit within the cozy walls of your tavern and pick up rumors to turn them into quests. Some of them are old sailor\u2019s yarn, so sort them thoroughly before sticking them up the wall! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you meet new and familiar faces, all seems well. Your establishment is flourishing and friendships are made. All until something starts brewing on the horizon, something that\u2019s going to twist your brightest dreams into your darkest nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500880/extras/c3f124cae6dc6ca7bb490d5e14bce495.avif?t=1755615483\" width=640 height=205 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in every good Pen &amp; Paper campaign, <i>Tavern Talk Stories: Dreamwalker</i> touches topics that may hit right in the feels. Please be aware that there will be mentions of death, grief and violence.</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome Tavernkeep! In this D&amp;D-inspired visual novel you will run a cozy seaside tavern, meet adventurers, gather rumours and mix fate-altering drinks to stop dreams from twisting into nightmares.",
